msgid "Prefix currency symbol"
msgstr ""

#: kcmlocale.cpp:1860
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the currency sign will be prefixed (i.e. to the "
"left of the value) for all positive monetary values. If not, it will be "
"postfixed (i.e. to the right)."
